@startuml save-load-flow
title Save / load slot (source/save/save.cpp)
actor Player
participant "menu.cpp" as Menu
participant "App" as App
participant "SimPipeline" as Sim
database "sdmc:/switch/nxsand/\nslot-N.json" as SD

== Save ==
Player -> Menu: confirm save slot
Menu -> App: saveGame(slot)
App -> Sim: readGridTo(raw)
Sim --> App: GL_R8UI readback
App -> App: flipGlRowsToTopDown
App -> App: JSON grid base64 +\nbrush + timestamp
App -> SD: atomicWriteFile

== Load ==
Player -> Menu: load slot
Menu -> App: loadGame(slot)
App -> SD: read slot-N.json
SD --> App: width height grid b64
App -> App: base64Decode + validate size
App -> Sim: uploadGridTopDown(dec)
App -> App: restore brush,\ngridHasMatter, wake sim
Menu -> App: scene = Play

@enduml
